<title>USA: Prestige sets $0.05/shr special dividend.</title>
<headline>Prestige sets $0.05/shr special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>FLEMINGTON, N.J. 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prestige Financial Corp, the holding company for Prestige State Bank, said on Friday it declared a special $0.05 per share cash dividend, payable December 31 to shareholders of record on December 20.</p>
<p>The company also declared a regular quarterly $0.05 per share dividend, with the same pay and record dates.</p>
